---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Meet Henrique | Private Chef in Portugal"
  description="Learn more about ByHenrique, the cooking approach and personalised services."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">About</p>

          <h1>ByHenrique</h1>

          <p class="lead">
            Personalised cooking for special moments, with attention to flavour,
            detail and each client’s experience.
          </p>

          <p>
            I am a chef and created ByHenrique to bring personalised menus,
            private meals and catering to clients looking for a careful,
            comfortable and tailored experience.
          </p>

          <p>
            My cooking values quality ingredients, balanced combinations and
            solutions adapted to each occasion: from a private dinner at home to
            a family meal or special event.
          </p>

          <p>
            I am available to private Chef experiences in several regions of Portugal, from intimate dinners at home to special events. I work
            in the Algarve, Alentejo, Greater Lisbon and the Center of Portugal, including
            Faro, Albufeira, Vilamoura, Quinta do Lago, Vale do Lobo, Portimão,
            Lagos, Tavira, Tróia, Comporta, Grândola, Alcácer do Sal, Sines,
            Santiago do Cacém, Leiria and Coimbra.
          </p>

            <img
              src="/images/OChefe.jpg"
              alt="Chef Henrique"
              class="section-image"
              loading="lazy"
              width="1200"
              height="800"  
            /> 
        </div>

        <aside class="card about-card">
          <h2>What you can expect</h2>

          <ul>
            <li>Menus adjusted to your taste</li>
            <li>Clear communication before booking</li>
            <li>Attention to allergies and dietary preferences</li>
            <li>Proposals for small events and special occasions</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section highlight-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Approach</p>

        <h2>Cooking designed for each context.</h2>

        <div class="values-grid">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Personalisation</h3>
            <p>
              Each request can be adapted to the number of people, occasion,
              preferences and budget.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Quality</h3>
            <p>
              Ingredient selection, preparation and presentation are handled
              carefully from the first contact.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Closeness</h3>
            <p>
              The process is simple and direct: we discuss what you need, adjust
              the menu and confirm the details.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
